{"id":"wb-6-211","name":"柳湾遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"柳湾遗址","text":"柳湾遗址，又名柳湾墓群、柳湾墓地，位于中华人民共和国青海省海东市乐都区，是于1974年在青海境内发现的新石器时代至青铜时代遗址，历史年代距今4600年—3600年，文化上并存马家窑文化、齐家文化、辛店文化等多种不同类型，被认为是中国黄河上游一带发掘规模最大的一处原始社会氏族公共墓群。2006年，柳湾遗址入选第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%B3%E6%B9%BE%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":88369871,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88369871","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8430a6870fe5f1562b90ee35.jpg","title":"青海柳湾遗址-彩陶壶3-马家窑文化-青海柳湾彩陶博物馆.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%9D%92%E6%B5%B7%E6%9F%B3%E6%B9%BE%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80-%E5%BD%A9%E9%99%B6%E5%A3%B63-%E9%A9%AC%E5%AE%B6%E7%AA%91%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96-%E9%9D%92%E6%B5%B7%E6%9F%B3%E6%B9%BE%E5%BD%A9%E9%99%B6%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/%E9%9D%92%E6%B5%B7%E6%9F%B3%E6%B9%BE%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80-%E5%BD%A9%E9%99%B6%E5%A3%B63-%E9%A9%AC%E5%AE%B6%E7%AA%91%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96-%E9%9D%92%E6%B5%B7%E6%9F%B3%E6%B9%BE%E5%BD%A9%E9%99%B6%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%A6%86.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Kcx36","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​彩陶壶\n马家窑文化（距今约5000-4000年）\n青海柳湾遗址出土\n青海柳湾彩陶博物馆藏\nPainted Pottery Pot\nAbout 5000-4000 Years Ago\nUnearthed from Liuwan Site in Qinghai Province\n\nQinghai Liuwan Painted Pottery Museum","width":320,"height":240},"editorialNotes":["根据对应公布名录及公布年份，更正百科文本中的批次笔误。"],"textScope":"body-excerpt"}